        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JAS.5.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yak 5:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Elia ma Jaticbi, ma en e mir umondo mi Gilead, uwacu ni Ahab kumae, Calu Yehova Mungu mir Israel ubedo kwo, m’acungo i wang’e, thoi kadi koth de bibedo mbe rundi maeni, ento calku lembe para. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E lembe pa Yehova bino i bang’e, uwacu kumae, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ai kakeni man ilokri yo nyangu, e ipond i ng’et kulo Kerith, ma ni i wang’ Yordan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ebibedo, nia ibimadhu kum kulone; man ang’olo ni ngoro y a giter cam iri kuca. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum kumeno ecidho etimo calku lembe pa Yehova; kum ecidho man ebedo ng’et kulo Kerith, ma ni i wang’ Yordan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E ngoro kelo ire kwen ku ring’o kugweno, man kwen ku ring’o uthieno; man emadhu kum kulone. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man etimbre yo ng’ei nindo moko, nia kulone dwono, kum koth umbe i ng’ombe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E lembe pa Yehova bino i bang’e, uwacu kumae, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.4.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 4:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.4.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ai, icidh Zarefath, ma en e pa Sidon, man ibed kuca: nen, ang’olo ni dhaku ma cware tho kuca nia egwoki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum kumeno eai man ecidho Zarefath; man kinde m’ewok dhugang’ mir adhurane, nen, dhaku ma cware tho ni keca m’ebecoko ridi: e elwong’e, ewacu kumae, Akwei, kel ira nyathi pi moko i agulu, kara amadhi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E kan ebecigamu, elwong’e, man ewacu kumae, Akwei, kel ira nyathi kwen i cingi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ewacu kumae, Calu Yehova Mungu peri bedo kwo, kwen m’apada mbe kuda, ndhu mogo ma theng’ cing’ i agulu, ku nyathi mo i cupa: man, nen, abekwanyu ridi ario, kara amond atede ira waku woda, kara wacame, e watho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Elia wacu ire kumae, Lworo kud unegi; cidh itim calu iwacu; ento ilar itim ira kudo nyathi kwen m’apada, man ikele woko i bang’a, man yo ku ng’eye itim iri man pi wodi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum Yehova, Mungu mir Israel, uwacu kumae, Agulu mi mogo bithum ungo, kadok cupa mi mo de bijik ungo, cil i ceng’ ma Yehova oro koth wi ng’om. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E ecidho etimo de calku lembawaca pa Elia: e dhakune, kud Elia, man juode, gicamu ceng’ dupa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agulu mi mogo thum ungo, kadok cupa mi mo de jik ungo, calku lembe pa Yehova, m’eyero ku dhu Elia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man etimbre yo ng’ei gin maeni, nia wod dhakune, ma won ode, kume make; e kume lith hai, ketho nia yuyo moko mbe m’udong’ i ie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ewacu ni Elia kumae, Wabedo ku lembang’o wakudi, E in m’i dhanu pa Mungu? ibino i bang’a kara jupoi kum dubo para, man kara ineg woda! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ewacu ire kumae, Mi wodi i bang’a. E egame kud i kore, man etere malu i kusika, ka m’ebedo i ie, man ekethe wi kavuto pare gire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E elwong’o Yehova, man ewacu kumae, E Yehova Mungu para, ikelo lembe ma rac bende wi dhaku ma cware mbe ma wabedo ni umondo wakugi, kunego wode? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.4.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ub 4:34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.4.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man eriebre gire wi nyathin wang’ adek, e elwong’o Yehova, ewacu de kumae, E Yehova Mungu para, akwei, wek ng’eyong’ec pa nyathin maeni dwog i ie kendo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Yehova winjo badwand Elia; man ng’eyong’ec pa nyathinne dwogo i ie kendo, man ecer. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Elia ting’o nyathin, man ekele piny ku i kusika etere i ot, man emie ba min mire; e Elia wacu kumae, Nen, wodi bedo kwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man dhakune wacu ni Elia kumae, Kawono ang’eyo nia in i dhanu pa Mungu man nia lembe pa Yehova m’i dhogi en e andha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
